    {
      "id": 12601,
      "hub_id": null,
      "version": "1.2.0",
      "description": "<p>Now a little bit more than just for barter items.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Slightly reworked the config.</li>\n<li>The config now automatically updates after saving. (But you need to restart the game client.)</li>\n<li>You can now set the maximum resource value.</li>\n<li>Fuel/filter/amulet now take one item from the stack.</li>\n<li>Now only items with the maximum resource value are stacked.</li>\n<li>Added a restriction on using a item with a resource from a stack.</li>\n<li>You can no longer place a stack in the Cultist Circle.</li>\n<li>Quests that require placing items now remove one item from the stack.</li>\n<li>Added a check for MedKitComponent, FoodDrinkComponent and RepairKitComponent.</li>\n<li>Added compatibility with the MergeConsumables mod.</li>\n</ul>\n",
